# Secrets for the JARVIS Edge Functions (jarvis-store-connection).
#
# Copy to  supabase/functions/.env  (gitignored), fill it in, then push:
#   supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/functions/.env --project-ref iqfrjomoggddxwteuigk
#
# Only APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY goes here. SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# are auto-injected by Supabase and are RESERVED — do not add them (the push
# will error on any SUPABASE_* name).
#
# OpenAI / Twilio / Google refresh token do NOT go here — those are Railway's
# (the backend can't read Supabase secrets). Put them in scripts/secrets.env.

# openssl rand -base64 32   (keep a copy; the phone backend needs the same value)
APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
